    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "4 people take 1 hour and 20 minutes to water a football pitch.\nHow long would it take to water the same pitch if 5 people worked together?\nGive your answer in hours and minutes.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "1 hr 4 min",
      "worked": "1 hour 20 minutes is 80 minutes. Let $t$ be the time in minutes and $N$ the number of people.\n$$\\begin{align*}t&=\\frac{k}{N}\\\\80&=\\frac{k}{4}\\\\k&=320\\\\t&=\\frac{320}{N}\\\\t&=\\frac{320}{5}\\\\t&=64\\end{align*}$$\n64 minutes is 1 hour 4 minutes.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 49
  },
